    "created_at": "2026-07-15T22:57:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-15T22:57:02Z",
    "body": "> [web-platform-tests/wpt#58991](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/58991) introduced assertions that CDATA should be handled as bogus comments at integration points. That conflicts with the specification as it is now.\n\nI followed up in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/61303 to fix those tests to match the specification. I've also updated WebKit to match the specification in https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/69464",
    "author_association": "NONE",
